      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 9:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hashishe Yehowa wakela dî dikole mu matshu anyi ne, Nuenu badi bakokesha ku mutu kua musoko eu, Nusemene ha buihi nʼanyi, muntu yonso ikale ne tshielelu tshiandi tshia nvita mu bianza biandi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.9.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.9.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 9:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Monai kabidi! Bantu basambombo bakafuma ku luseke lua ku tshibi tshia ku mutu tshiakadi tshitangile ku luseke lua node. Muntu yonso wa munkatshi muabo wakadi ne tshilonda tshiandi mu tshianza tshiandi. Munkatshi muabo muakadi muntu mukuabo muluate bivualu bia lin, muikale ne kalondo ka mai a mukanda ka mufundi kasuika mu tshifuka tshiandi. Bakabuela mu ntempelo, hakimana hehi ne tshioshelu tshia tshiamu tshia mitaku.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.9.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.9.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 9:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.9.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.9.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 9:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Butumbi hua Nzambi wa Isalele buakumuka ku mutu kua bakeluba kuakadibu bushikame diambedi, buakaya ku mbelu kua nsubu. Yeye wakela dî kudi muntu wakadi muluate bivualu bia lin, wakadi ne kalondo ka mai a mukanda ka mufundi kasuika mu tshifuka tshiandi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.9.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.9.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 9:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehowa mene wakamuambila ne, Hitshila mu musoko, munkatshi mua misesu ya Yelushalema mene, funda tshimanyinu ha mpala ha bantu badi bahumuna muoyo ne badi badila bualu bua malu a bundu adi bakuabo benza munkatshi muau. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.9.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.9.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 9:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakambila bakuabo mu matshu anyi ne, Yai, nuhitshile mu musoko ku nyima kuandi, nutahe bantu. Mesu enu kâbatangidi ne dinanga, kanubafuidi luse; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.9.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.9.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 9:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "shihai bantu bakulumpe, bansongalume ne mishikankunde, bana batekete ne bakashi; kadi kanuyi ha buihi ne muntu umue udi ne tshimanyinu atshi. Bangilai ku nsubu wanyi wa tshijila. Nunku bakabanga kushiha bakulu bakadi ku mpala kua nsubu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.9.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.9.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 9:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeye wakabambila ne, Nyangai nsubu eu, nûshe biendelu biandi tente ne bantu hanudi nushiha, nulubukemu. Bakaluhukamu, hakashiha bantu mu musoko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.9.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 9:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakadibo bashiha bantu bakuabo ne hanakashala nkayanyi, nakatua mpala wanyi hanshi, nakabandisha dî dianyi, nakamba ne, Aka, Mukelenge Yehowa! Neushihe bonso ba mu Isalele badi bashala ne muoyo mu kuhumuna eku kua tshiji tshiebe tshikole hamʼbidi ha Yelushalema, anyi?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.9.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.9.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 9:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.9.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.9.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 9:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hashishe yeye wakangambila ne, Bubi bua Bena Isalele ne bua Bena Yuda budi buhita hunene, buloba budi bûle tente ne kumatshisha kua mashi, ne musoko udi mûle tente ne kunyanga kua bilumbu bia bantu. Bualu bua badi bamba ne, Yehowa wakulekela buloba buetu, ne Yehowa kena utumona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.9.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 9:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nunku meme hanyi tshiena mbalesha dinanga, tshiena mbafuila luse, kadi nempingashe dikenga bu difutu dia bienzedi biabo ha mitu babo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.9.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.9.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
